                <mxCell id="n-env" value="PROD specifics: Aurora provisioned 3×db.r7g.large, deletion-protection ON, 30d backup, Performance Insights. MSK = Provisioned (3×kafka.m7g.large, 3.9.x.kraft, TLS :9094 + IAM SASL :9098, at-rest KMS data). NAT 3 (per-AZ). All 5 per-env KMS keys + 6 task roles identical to dev/beta. github-pat-amplify secret NOT created (enable_amplify=false)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=light-dark(#FFF8E1,#3A3320);strokeColor=#FFB300;fontColor=light-dark(#5D4037,#FFE0B2);size=14;" parent="aws" vertex="1">
